#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:1
#: 8f81caa09c964b93b30e5bc119907dd6
msgid "ARX Lift 2S"
msgstr "方舟无限 Lift 2S"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:3
#: fafdb07db14c4a8f8847ec3aad3f7a16
msgid ""
"**ARX** (方舟无限) is the brand. **Lift 2S** is that brand’s full-body "
"**mobile manipulator**: arms **plus** lift axis and **mobile base / "
"chassis**, not an arm-only robot."
msgstr ""
"**方舟无限**（ARX）是品牌。**Lift 2S** 是该品牌的全身 **移动操作臂**：手臂 **加上** 升降轴和 "
"**移动底盘**，不是仅机械臂的机器人。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:5
#: 403cd99a21244a85a1fc075b44d739d1
msgid ""
"**Acone** / **AC One** is the **arm portion** of the same stack "
"(manipulator only). It is not the Lift 2S platform. The `arx-lift2s` "
"workspace can launch Acone from `quick_start` for co-debug; the product "
"focus of that branch is Lift 2S."
msgstr ""
"**Acone** / **AC One** 是同一套栈中的 **机械臂部分**（仅操作臂）。它不是 Lift 2S 整机。`arx-"
"lift2s` 工作空间可在 `quick_start` 中启动 Acone 做联调；该分支的产品重点是 Lift 2S。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:7
#: 54f67136a169465ea9d3d4009327b01a
msgid ""
"Brand labels follow [robot_usds README_zh-CN.md §3.1](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/robot_usds/blob/main/README_zh-CN.md#31-中文简称与英文标识对照): 方舟无限 "
"= ARX. Do not use bare “Ark” as the brand name."
msgstr ""
"品牌标注遵循 [robot_usds README_zh-CN.md §3.1](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot_usds/blob/main/README_zh-CN.md#31-中文简称与英文标识对照)：方舟无限 = "
"ARX。不要用单独的 “Ark” 当品牌名。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:9
#: 2ebd5a00b9eb40a0b5ddf31cc5be3c07
msgid "Source of truth"
msgstr "以源仓库为准"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:12
#: 954a01a9dfc9493c86b8ea7d192bd850
msgid "Follow the branch README. Do not invent extra launch flags."
msgstr "遵循分支 README。不要编造额外的 launch 参数。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:14
#: bae1faab9524446fa597513fe01ad9e0
msgid ""
"Chinese: [open-deploy-ws `arx-lift2s` README](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/blob/arx-lift2s/README.md)"
msgstr ""
"中文：[open-deploy-ws `arx-lift2s` README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim"
"/open-deploy-ws/blob/arx-lift2s/README.md)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:15
#: 2ce8240a77f146159e63edaede75a6f9
msgid ""
"English: [README.EN.md](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-"
"ws/blob/arx-lift2s/README.EN.md)"
