"/arx-lift2s/README.EN.md)"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:18
#: a07502239a1c4d038a41e6379e5c2b57
msgid "Clone and init"
msgstr "克隆与初始化"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:20
#: ee072f90a8b84c54be9c3c561eee32bf
msgid "From the README (directory name `lift2s-ws` is the example):"
msgstr "来自 README（目录名 `lift2s-ws` 为示例）："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:22
#: ad0ba90e298c4f1893c7cfa9202b62c1
msgid ""
"cd ~\n"
"git clone -b arx-lift2s git@github.com:fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git "
"lift2s-ws\n"
"cd ~/lift2s-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh"
msgstr ""
"cd ~\n"
"git clone -b arx-lift2s git@github.com:fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws.git "
"lift2s-ws\n"
"cd ~/lift2s-ws\n"
"./init_repo.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:29
#: 4dec53f300874d0b83e5d36b862bcfea
msgid ""
"Field zip (README): unzip, then `./release.sh --install`, then "
"`./quick_start.sh`. Descriptions stay as source; controllers / hardware "
"interface come from `.deb`."
msgstr ""
"现场 zip（README）：解压后执行 `./release.sh --install`，再执行 "
"`./quick_start.sh`。描述保持源码；控制器 / 硬件接口来自 `.deb`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:31
#: b12c177802a246cc87be59c890a60d97
msgid "Build and launch (scripts first)"
msgstr "编译与启动（脚本优先）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:33
#: 314e960fac364a6a9496b09b20484fbf
msgid ""
"Primary path is `./quick_start.sh` (scenario build + Lift2S split/full "
"body, simulation or real):"
msgstr "主路径是 `./quick_start.sh`（按场景编译 + Lift2S 分身/全身，仿真或真机）："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:35
#: 87a0eeecaa084d249147889ae0a5a1e3
msgid ""
"cd ~/lift2s-ws\n"
"./quick_start.sh"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/lift2s-ws\n"
"./quick_start.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:40
#: 3d158d5c866140e3a8ad7b23ac45f9f7
msgid "README menu:"
msgstr "README 菜单："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:42
#: 058960c66bf143f4a5e4564c8eae1690
msgid ""
"**Build** — simulation packages, or real-hardware packages (includes "
"`arx_ros2_control`)"
msgstr "**编译** — 仿真软件包，或真机软件包（含 `arx_ros2_control`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:43
#: 8f3d34598a2148428a6cbaab2b7f7a6d
msgid ""
"**Launch** — choose **Lift2S**, then **split body** or **full body**, "
"then simulation (`mock_components`) or **real hardware**"
msgstr "**启动** — 选择 **Lift2S**，再选 **分身** 或 **全身**，然后仿真（`mock_components`）或 **真机**"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:45
#: 8862e4e6ade047a185aa258fed2ce250
msgid ""
"CAN (README): left/right arms `can1` / `can3`; no network IP. Lift axis "
"defaults to `hybrid` (change to `soft_p` in `quick_start`)."
msgstr ""
"CAN（README）：左右臂 `can1` / `can3`；没有网络 IP。升降轴默认 `hybrid`（可在 `quick_start` "
"中改为 `soft_p`）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:47
#: 53dfa4cae20f4686b15440c5c708c950
msgid ""
"X5 / R5 / **ACone** / Lift / X7S in the same menu are `robot-"
"descriptions-arx` models for **co-debug**. Pick **ACone** only when you "
"want the **arm**, not the full Lift 2S chassis."
msgstr ""
"同一菜单中的 X5 / R5 / **ACone** / Lift / X7S 是用于 **联调** 的 `robot-descriptions-"
"arx` 模型。只有在需要 **机械臂**、而不是完整 Lift 2S 底盘时才选 **ACone**。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:49
#: a1531bc37e02422884b7b7f6b7e093a1
msgid "Optional README launch lines"
msgstr "README 中的可选 launch 行"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:51
#: 4d9fc10fd6ba4c7a86843e9253e45ba4
msgid ""
"Prefer the script. These are the README’s optional equivalents for "
"**Lift2S**:"
msgstr "优先用脚本。以下是 README 中 **Lift2S** 的可选等价命令："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:53
#: 5d79158d46a74e0d971c61ccb4823309
msgid ""
"source ~/lift2s-ws/install/setup.bash\n"
"# Visualization\n"
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s\n"
"# Split body / full body (add hardware:=real for the robot)\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller split_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s"
msgstr ""
"source ~/lift2s-ws/install/setup.bash\n"
"# Visualization\n"
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch manipulator.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s\n"
"# Split body / full body (add hardware:=real for the robot)\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller split_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py robot:=arx_lift2s"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:62
#: 0551d61b4c51419998b94294cb3d357f
msgid ""
"Zenoh: README asks for `sudo apt install ros-jazzy-rmw-zenoh-cpp` and "
"`export RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp` on the deploy host."
msgstr ""
"Zenoh：README 要求在部署主机上执行 `sudo apt install ros-jazzy-rmw-zenoh-cpp` 并 "
"`export RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp`。"

